ADA TOSHIHARU</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGASAKA FUMIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HISAMATSU, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATADA, TOSHIHARU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGASAKA, FUMIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HISAMATSU YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATADA TOSHIHARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGASAKA FUMIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HISAMATSU, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATADA, TOSHIHARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGASAKA, FUMIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An application unit (112) in a CPU (110) allows a device search window to be displayed on the screen of a monitor (180) (S100).  The user inputs the name of the objective person in the name input space in the device search window and presses the search start button.  The application unit (112) detects the input, makes an access to a server (400) and acquires the name of the device correlated to the name of the objective person (S106) from the information registered in a shared database (410).  The application unit (112) allows the icon corresponding to the acquired name of the device (S108) to be displayed on the screen.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une unité d'application (112) dans une unité centrale de traitement (110) permettant d'afficher une fenêtre de recherche de dispositif sur l'écran d'un moniteur (180) (S100). L'utilisateur entre le nom de la personne physique dans l'espace destiné à cet effet à l'intérieur de cette fenêtre de recherche, et enfonce la touche de départ de recherche. L'unité d'application (112) détecte l'entrée, accède au serveur (400) et obtient le nom du dispositif associé au nom de la personne physique (S106) à partir des informations enregistrées dans une base de données commune (410). L'unité d'application (112) permet d'afficher sur l'écran l'icone correspondant au nom du dispositif obtenu (S108).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>